 <body>
   <main class="card">
     <p class="eyebrow">Preferences</p>
     <h1>Choose your notification style</h1>
     <p class="intro">Pick the one channel you want us to use for product updates and account activity.</p>

     <form id="notification-form">
       <div class="form-field">
         <span class="question">How do you prefer to receive notifications?</span>
         <div class="choices" role="radiogroup" aria-label="How do you prefer to receive notifications?">
